          <h2 class="text-3xl font-black text-gray-900 mt-16 mb-6">
            2. What Are the Best Solar Power Banks in 2026?
          </h2>

          <p>
            The seven products below are not all the same kind of thing, and that is on purpose. Four are folding USB solar chargers, one is a panel with a small battery built in, one is a power bank with integrated solar cells, and one is an ordinary battery bank chosen to pair with a panel. The best way to charge a phone from the sun is usually two products working together rather than one product doing both jobs poorly.
          </p>

          <p>
            We have not put these through a test program of our own. The specs on each card are the manufacturers’ published figures, and the output expectations come from the energy arithmetic later in this guide rather than from measurements.
          </p>

