          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most people the best solar power bank is a pair of products: a 21-28W folding panel to gather sunlight and a plain 10,000-20,000mAh bank to hold it. The BigBlue 28W with an Anker 335 is the combination we would choose for most buyers; backpackers should look at the Anker 21W, and the BioLite SolarPanel 10+ is the one all-in-one with a sensible panel-to-battery ratio.
          </p>
